    (276076, 'Duality', 'confirmed_native',         'Fel Infused Weapon - hybrid AP*0.05+SP*0.05+flat Shadowflame proc, no ICD in tooltip, fires on every auto attack AND melee ability. Primer §1 (v6).'),
    (272624, 'Shaman',  'confirmed_class_tag_rule', 'Molten Earth - live tooltip confirms "uses Fire Nova modifiers". Triggered by Lava Lash (Shaman) but NOT modified by Lava Lash talents (Elemental Fusion, Lava Flows) - class-tag rule proof case #2, Primer §4. Formula: 60+(SP+AP)*0.12 Fire dmg/tick, 8 ticks.'),
